Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(chat): use full prompt_tokens (in=) not uncached
 input for context UI

Hermes CanonicalUsage.input_tokens is uncached-only. Context occupancy must
use prompt_tokens (= input + cache_read + cache_write), matching agent log in=.
